## EXISTING DATABASE TABLES (reference only — do NOT modify)

### `scam_brands` — 9k+ rows, key fields:
id, name, slug, normalized_name, total_creatives, total_geos, total_celebrities, total_videos, geo_list (jsonb), celebrity_list (jsonb), language_list (jsonb), first_seen_at, last_seen_at, lifespan_days, velocity_7d, velocity_trend, scam_score (0-100), status (active/inactive)

### `reviews` — existing brand review articles:
id, brand_id, slug, title, headline, meta_description, summary, full_article (HTML), red_flags (jsonb), faq (jsonb), verdict, schema_json (jsonb), word_count, status (draft/published), published_at, sources (jsonb), methodology, experience_signals, expertise_depth

### `creatives` — 76k+ scraped ad creatives:
id, offer_name, normalized_offer, celebrity_name, geo, is_video, land_language, created_at, first_seen_at, last_seen_at, scrape_count

