## UI DESIGN GUIDELINES

- **Dark theme:** bg-dark-bg (#0a0a0a), cards use bg-gray-900/50 + border-gray-800/60
- **Colors:** Red for primary actions/scam scores, Blue for active states, Green for success, Amber for warnings
- **Badges:** Rounded-full with bg-{color}-500/10 + text-{color}-400
- **Typography:** text-white for headings, text-gray-400 for body, text-gray-500/600 for secondary
- **Cards:** rounded-xl border p-4/p-5
- **Buttons:** Primary: bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-500 text-white. Secondary: border-gray-700 text-gray-400
- **Tables:** text-sm, border-b border-gray-800/30 rows, hover:bg-white/[0.02]
- **No external UI libraries.** Use only Tailwind classes. Icons are inline SVGs.

